# Static demo is the default. Use pnpm dev:full / pnpm build:full for account features.
# The optional development API proxy is configured in the shell running Vite:
# T3_API_PROXY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
#
# Operator identity and optional analytics are runtime public JSON, not VITE_* env.
# Serve site-config.json next to index.html. Without it analytics stays disabled.
# See docs/site-configuration.md for the schema. Never put credentials in that file.
